; States file for Ice (hypers)
;
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Vars:
;   0: for Super Jump (0=vertical, 1=forward, -1=backward)
;   1: keep track of power level (for levelup sounds)
; Helpers:
;   0: superjump opponent position indicator
;   12: ice slick
;   15: ice maiden
; Explods:
;   10: ice shards when leaving "frozen" state 
; 3510: Absolute Zero (blizzard) snow
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------


;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Hyper Attacks
; 
; Hyper Ice Ball  (D,DF,F + PP)  -- states 3000-3062
;   Ice gathers energy in her hand and then she fires the hyper iceball at 
;   the opponent. This version of the iceball does damage, freezes the oponent 
;   for 12 seconds, and can destroy projectiles
; Absolute Zero  (D,DB,B + KK)  -- states 3500-3511
;   Ice calls down a snowstorm, which heals a portion of her life and drains the
;   opponent's powerbar.
; Iceberg  (Amalgam Hyper -- D,DF,F + HP+HK)  -- states 4000-4006
;   Ice dashes to the opponent very quickly (with after images), touches him with both hands, 
;   and then freezes a huge ball of ice around them. Then she kicks it skyward, shattering 
;   the ice and leaving the poor sap to fall back to the ground--HARD.
; IceQuake (Hyper Ice Wave -- D,DB,B + PP) -- states 4500-4501
;   Huge freaking ice from underground heaves up right underneath P2, launching 
;   them and doing massive damage
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------


